<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/16th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Italian War of 1521–1526</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1521">1521</a>–<a href="/years/1526">1526</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a> · Also known as Four Years' War · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italian-wars">Italian Wars</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Italian War of 1521–1526 was fought between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/francis-i">Francis I</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a> and Emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/charles-v-holy-roman-emperor">Charles V</a>, allied with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/henry-viii-of-england">Henry VIII of England</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/papacy">papacy</a>, mainly over the Duchy of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/milan">Milan</a>. After French defeats at Bicocca (1522) and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sesia">Sesia</a> (1524), Francis was captured at Pavia in 1525 and forced to accept the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-madrid-1526">Treaty of Madrid (1526)</a>, which he repudiated on his release.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/italian-war-of-1521-1526.jpg" alt="Italian War of 1521–1526" width="320" height="208" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown Flemish artist · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Battle_of_Pavia_-_Unknown_Artist_-_Google_Cultural_Institute.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section><h2 class="enc-section-title">Battles and settlements</h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-madrid-1526"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/treaty-of-madrid-1526.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Treaty of Madrid (1526)</span><span class="tp">Treaty · Peace · 14 January 1526</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
